    "summary": "Each player whose army meets the Battle Ready painting standard scores 10 VP. Most VP wins; equal totals are a draw.\n\nVP above these caps are ignored:\n\n- Primary Mission: 45 VP per battle, at most 15 VP per battle round.\n- Secondary Missions: 45 VP per battle, at most 15 VP per battle round, and at most 20 VP from each [Fixed Secondary Mission](vsdata:core-rule/chapter-approved.fixed-secondary-missions) card.\n- Battle Ready: 10 VP.",
